# Short frames: dry Joint at U7 pin 4 (D, V2); it floats high, so line 307 decodes as the frame end
# and the frame is 308 lines: line 308 never comes, so no TICK_N (no paddle triggers) and no MOVE
# (the ball stays on its power-on column, often off the picture). The vertical sync (lines 272-287,
# P6n) still comes: the picture holds.
machine tennis
title "Lost paddles"
brief "The paddles are gone and the ball never comes across the court."
fault joint U7.4
